/* Editor decors are map tiles/sprites that are only used during the construction of the map. 
   Info: ⚠️ Remove editor sprites placed in your map before publishing! ⚠️
   These TF layer sprites aren't rendered on the unit layer (later in the render stack) so they get tiled over
     by adjacent tile top-down rendering. :P
*/

	// Special spacer entity. Used only for the Edit menu. Blank alpha .png sprite associated for menu aesthetics.
	// ⚠️ Unicode works fine, however cannot be placed in a subfolder.
	{
		"name": "⚕⚕ Eᴅɪᴛᴏʀ Sᴘʀɪᴛᴇs ⚕⚕",
		"type": "TerrainFeature",
		"unbuildable": true,
		"uniques": ["Editor"],
	},

	/* "Editor" entity definition, for an Improvement "terrainsCanBeBuiltOn". Any improvement entity with "Editor"
	     as a terrainsCanBeBuiltOn can then have "Editor" tagged sprites applied to an improvement tile.
	     Cannot use this technique on Natural Wonders since no TF can be applied to them. 
	   To activate, specify the entity name in the terrain block unique as a tag.
	⚠️ A `name` using unicode characters will silently not work. the "name": must be non-unicode. :(
	*/
	{
